      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task is to create a Python file named `submit_transcription.py` that submits an audio file for batch transcription using a concrete external provider. The chosen provider for this task is Amazon Transcribe, a popular speech-to-text service. The code will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with Amazon Transcribe. The provider will be identifiable through the import of the Boto3 library and the use of the Amazon Transcribe client. </thinking>\n",
